# shape: reset sheets and legacy IE hacks built on the universal selector (`* html #x`, `#menu > *`, `*, *::before`), and a selector a browser drops (`input:not(type="checkbox")`)
kinds=styles,unknown
@@@ file: src/index.html
<!doctype html>
<html>
<head><link rel="stylesheet" href="s.css"></head>
<body>
<div id="menu"><a>1</a><span>2</span></div><input type="checkbox" class="i">
</body>
</html>
@@@ file: src/s.css
*, *::before { a: 1 }
* html #menu { a: 2 }
#menu > * { a: 3 }
#menu * + * { a: 4 }
*|* .i { a: 5 }
input:not(type="checkbox") { a: 6 }
